+    // Attention offload to an Intel XPU through libtorch (SD_XPU_SDPA_LIB=path/to/libxpu_sdpa.so).
+    // On Arc Pro B70 its oneDNN/SYCL kernels run ~5x faster than any Vulkan FA path, because Vulkan
